{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id408071797"}, "name":{"label":"🤷🏾‍♀️🤷🏾‍♀️"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-28T06:32:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.14.0"}, "id":{"label":"14358416674"}, "title":{"label":"Needs improvement"}, "content":{"label":"I see two providers who utilize this app. I have to search for the link for each practice. It doesn’t show all the appointments like a normal portal. I had to enter the information for each link. I have to completely sign out and find website for each practice to do anything. There should be an option to switch with the app. Otherwise it’s too much work. I see reviews talking about this 3 years ago and it appears nothing had changed", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1036175909&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id38808312"}, "name":{"label":"hunting app developer"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-23T07:05:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.14.0"}, "id":{"label":"14338579098"}, "title":{"label":"Glitchy on iPad and iPhone"}, "content":{"label":"Had to get for my doctor appt, and first tried on my IPad but couldn’t get the keyboard to display.  Then got further on iPhone but took 5 tries to get the sign prompt to appear.  Gave up on the rest.  Seems to have a lot of bugs but can be useful.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1036175909&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
